
MageIWC_w.png / MageIWC_b.png (m-accuracy 2026-11-26): the IWC Mage skin of xRximnDlQtI / 4FRsSJoxMkE. The wizard is keyed out of
the video's own thumbnail (i.ytimg.com/vi/xRximnDlQtI/maxresdefault.jpg, flat #0078FF background; saved as
research/frames/video_thumbs/xRximnDlQtI_maxresdefault.jpg), alpha eroded 1 px against the blue fringe, then placed in the same
token style as Mage_w/Mage_b (black rim, team ring, pale-blue disc), 512 px. 3D standing cutout: ../cu3d/MageIWC.png (512 px,
feet at the bottom centre, ~90% height).
